\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\ul\b YORUMUM:\ulnone\b0  Ya\'fea, varol arkada\'fe; eline, diline, y\'fcre\'f0ine sa\'f0l\'fdk! \'c7in'in ABD-\'ddsrail ikilisine atfen n\'fckleersizle\'fetirme \'e7a\'f0r\'fds\'fd \'e7ok isabetli. Unutmay\'fdn atom bombas\'fdn\'fd ABD, yahudi Openheimer heyetine geli\'fetirtip, d\'fcnyada yegane kullan\'fdc\'fd olarak Japona att\'fd, bug\'fcne kadar da okyanus tsunamilerinde, T\'fcrkiye \'ddran Suriye Venezuela n\'fckleerdepremlerinde kulland\'fd. Y\'fdlda $4Mr silah hibesiyle Filistin soyk\'fdr\'fdmc\'fdl\'fd\'f0\'fdn\'fd azmettirdi. \'ddran\'fd-Hutiyi ezip, ABD H\'fcrm\'fcz ve Bab-el-Mandeb %20 hara\'e7 gardiyan\'fd oldu. K\'fdsa/uzun 7/24 varant TPi\'e7Bank varant r\'fc\'fevetine sat\'fdlmay\'fdp, BM, sadece \'ddran de\'f0il, ba\'feta ABD-\'ddsrail olmak \'fczere t\'fcm \'fclkelere n\'fckleersizle\'fetirme rejimi-disiplini uygulamal\'fd. Yegane m\'fcstakbelallahl\'fd\'f0a tap\'fdnan Tanr\'fdTrump & Tanr\'fdMusa tarikat\'fd, \'f6l\'fcm-do\'f0umlarla \'e7o\'f0ulcu i\'feg\'f6ren vatanda\'fea hi\'e7bir zaman (\'feeffaf internet liste gerid\'f6n\'fc\'fe kontrollu) oy hakk\'fd tan\'fdmaz.. ta ki kendisi de yegane m\'fcstakbelallahl\'fdktan \'e7o\'f0ulcu empatik i\'feg\'f6renli\'f0e tenezz\'fcl buyura!.. Ya\'f0f\'fd\'e7\'fds\'fd, bok\'e7uval\'fd, ossuruktulumu ketum vahiy-tiyoyla deforme-foseptik popo-sat\'fdc\'fd tough-gay ibnirospular...\lang1033\f0\par
